at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-17T07:05:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T08:11:34Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested versions: 4.4-stable, 4.7.2-stable, master\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\n**tldr**\ncurrently, because of mis-placed parameters, unreliable packets from clients to the server can be dropped for a several seconds (~4ish ) after a client connects, and then it recovers. resetting bandwidth limit immediately after server creation clears the bandwidth limit, and mostly fixes it.\n\n**details**\n\ncreate_server calls:\n`host->create_host_bound(bind_ip, p_port, p_max_clients, 0, p_max_channels > 0 ? p_max_channels + SYSCH_MAX : 0, p_out_bandwidth);`\n\n\nThe signature is `create_host_bound(address, port, max_peers, max_channels, in_bandwidth, out_bandwidth)`, so the channel count becomes the incoming bandwidth and p_in_bandwidth is ignored. With 3 channels the server advertises 5 bytes/s.\n\nIf a client's bandwidth throttle runs before the server's next BANDWIDTH_LIMIT clears that (e.g. the server is busy for a second), the client's packetThrottleLimit drops to 1 and it drops nearly all unreliable packets for several seconds.\n\nWe saw client input going missing for a few seconds after joining. On the client, get_peer(1).get_statistic(PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_LIMIT) reads 1. Workaround: host.bandwidth_limit(0, 0) right after create_server.\n\nSame bug as #123254, which was closed by the reporter. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. create_server(port, 1, 3) and connect a client.\n2. Stop polling the server for ~1.2 s while the client keeps polling and sending unreliable packets.\n3. Read PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_LIMIT on the client's peer for the server: it's 1, not 32.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nProject is private I cannot share it unfortunately","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124570/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}